  <name>Venera Unified</name>
  <summary>Cross-platform comic reader with scriptable sources and local library</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.ACGNnsj">
    <name>ACGNnsj</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>Venera Unified is a cross-platform comic reader with JavaScript source extensions and a local library.</p>
    <p>Browse and read comics from extensible sources, organize a local collection, and sync reading progress across devices.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Read comics from scriptable online sources</li>
      <li>Manage a local library with download and export</li>
      <li>Sync reading progress and favorites via WebDAV</li>
      <li>Built-in image translation with on-device OCR</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
